# m3_boss: the M2 sweep, plus the wasm test hooks: god mode at 31 (hits are
# ignored) and warp at 32 (waves jump to the 66 s WARNING). Boss spawns 393 (phase 2), fights
# from ~457. Since M6 its first fire phase change (240 fighting ticks, update 697) drops a
# crate, the F of the drop sequence, which the sweep collects at 841: twin zaps (F2), so the
# boss's HP runs out at 922 instead of ~1008. Death sequence, then "+500" and "STAGE 2" at
# 983 (phase 3, stage_clears 1), waves resume at 1103 (phase 0).
--frames 1400 --call-at "31 debug_god" --call-at "32 debug_warp" --dump-exports debug_state,debug_stage,debug_stage_clears,debug_boss_hp,debug_phase,debug_score --at "100 debug_phase == 1" --at "500 debug_boss_hp > 0" --at "500 debug_phase == 2" --at "696 debug_drops == 0" --at "697 debug_drops == 1" --at "840 debug_weapon == 1" --at "841 debug_weapon == 2" --at "982 debug_stage_clears == 0" --at "983 debug_stage_clears == 1" --expect "debug_stage_clears == 1" --expect "debug_stage == 1" --expect "debug_state == 1" --expect "debug_score > 500"
